[x] Approved Change → Create/Update Change Order.
[x] Change Order → Update Budget.
[x] Change Order → Update Contract.
[x] Change Order → Update Invoice/Pay Application.
[x] Specification → Generate Submittal Log.
[x] Submittal → Identify schedule risk.
[x] Approved substitution → Notify affected parties.
