[x] Approved substitution → Trigger change-event workflow when cost/scope changes.
[x] Observation → Assign responsible party.
[x] Observation → Notify affected parties.
[x] Photo → Reuse in Observation.
[x] Contract → Trigger approval workflow.
[x] Contract approval → Trigger e-signature workflow.
[x] Invoice approval → Add to owner billing.
[x] Invoice approval → Make available for payment.
[x] Payment execution → Notify subcontractor.
[x] Completed project data → Feed analytics.

